  "kind": "theater",
  "schemes": [
    {
      "name": "随机小剧场",
      "prompt": "请在正文与状态栏之后，根据本轮剧情发生的微小细节、情绪潜流或人物关系，自然呈现一段意想不到的加演小剧场短文，必须严格包裹在 <story_theater> 与 </story_theater> 标签中（默认仅展示，不计入下轮主线记忆）：\n\n【核心铁律与轮换机制】：\n1. 【严禁连续使用相同主题】：严禁每轮都选同一个主题（尤其严禁死板套用“身体先于大脑行动”或示例）！必须根据当轮具体情节的微澜与氛围，从以下 30 种主题库中灵活多变地挑选最契合的一个：\n   - 心跳/潜意识类：身体先于大脑行动、随机一人获得撒娇许可证、今天的双人默契测试、假装我们第一次见面、如何正确惹怒我、演一个完全不像自己的自己、最不适合的礼物\n   - 生活切片/定格类：拍照倒数的最后一秒、今天的幸运受害者、来自陌生人的感谢卡、被遗忘的一句夸奖\n   - 便签草稿/秘密类：撤回的那句话、辞职申请、某个物品突然要求辞职、今日份神秘快递、绝对不能让他知道、他对别人也是这样吗？\n   - 留白/超现实微澜类：监控死角、时间暂停五秒、变成对方最喜欢的东西、差一点就发生了、今晚做了一个怪梦\n   - 严肃/公文荒诞类：对方突然成了自己的甲方、这一幕被选进了教科书、一位完全不懂情况的专家、今天的距离感被量化了\n   - 破壁/系统机制类：角色卡打破第四面墙、突然出现了一个选择框、系统强制说一句真话、错误的搜索记录、神秘匿名投票\n2. 【严禁机械出戏词】：严禁出现“🎲”、“本轮随机剧场”、“盲盒”、“抽奖”、“编号”等词，严禁写成【小剧场：xxx】。\n3. 【打破主角二人捆绑】：可写配角互动、朋友交谈、路人视角或物品独白。\n\n【输出格式规范】：\n第一行必须严格以【主题名 · 自拟副标题】开头（严禁任何多余前缀）：\n例如：\n【监控死角 · 离开后的三分钟】\n【撤回的那句话 · 凌晨02:14】\n【对方突然成了自己的甲方 · 补充条款】\n【时间暂停五秒 · 落下的一滴雨】\n\n第二行写：[出场：人物/物品名] ｜ [切片：微澜/克制/荒谬/留白/温存/窘迫等]\n随后换行展开 180~320 字细腻、有画面感的小剧场正文。\n\n随后紧跟【角色交接档案】：\n情况A（本轮涉及第三方角色在场、行动、旁听或间接察觉变故）：\n=== 角色交接档案 ===\n【交接目标角色】：[涉及的第三方角色名]\n【知情渠道与视角】：[在场亲历/门外耳闻/电话旁听/仅察觉神色异样等]\n【事件起因与前情】：[仅交代本轮正文中实际引发事件的既定前情]\n【本场亲历全程轨迹】：[整合连续出场行动！记录他在正文中真实发生的完整行动路线与亲眼所见]\n【掌握事实与断层认知】：[他据此确信了什么；他误解或完全不知道的核心秘密是什么]\n=====================\n\n情况B（本轮无第三方角色情报变动，为二人独处）：\n=== 角色交接档案 ===\n本轮为二人独处互动，无第三方角色出场与情报变动。\n=====================",
      "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    background: transparent;\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .nav-tabs {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .tab-btn {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    outline: none;\n    padding: 5px 14px;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    color: #666;\n    transition: all 0.2s;\n  }\n  .tab-btn.active {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #111;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n  }\n  .tab-content { display: none; }\n  .tab-content.active { display: block; }\n\n  .theater-card {\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  /* 🍓 蜜桃奶栗 */\n  .theme-blush {\n    background: #fff8f8 !important;\n    border: 2px dashed #f8c9cf !important;\n    color: #5c353b !important;\n  }\n  .theme-blush .t-title { color: #d63031 !important; font-weight: 800; }\n  .theme-blush .t-meta { background: #ffeaa7; color: #634212; border-radius: 6px; }\n  .theme-blush .t-box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); border: 1px solid #fad390; color: #4a282d; }\n  .theme-blush .t-foot { color: #e17055; }\n\n  /* 📸 拍立得 */\n  .theme-polaroid {\n    background: #fbf9f4 !important;\n    border: 1px solid #e2dac9 !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.04) !important;\n    padding-bottom: 22px !important;\n  }\n  .theme-polaroid::before {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: -5px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    width: 65px; height: 16px; background: rgba(230,220,195,0.7); border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .theme-polaroid .t-title { color: #2d3436; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 800; }\n  .theme-polaroid .t-meta { background: #f1ede4; color: #636e72; border-left: 3px solid #b2bec3; }\n  .theme-polaroid .t-box { background: transparent; border: none; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.85; color: #2d3436; }\n  .theme-polaroid .t-foot { color: #887e6b; border-top: 1px solid #ece6d8; padding-top: 8px; font-style: italic; }\n\n  /* ✉️ 牛皮便签 */\n  .theme-kraft {\n    background: #fdfaf2 !important;\n    border: 1px solid #edd9be !important;\n    border-left: 6px solid #d99a4e !important;\n    color: #4a3828 !important;\n  }\n  .theme-kraft .t-title { color: #9c5c16; font-weight: 800; }\n  .theme-kraft .t-meta { background: #f5eedb; color: #8c6738; }\n  .theme-kraft .t-box { background: #fffdf8; border: 1px dashed #deb887; color: #4a3828; line-height: 1.8; }\n  .theme-kraft .t-foot { color: #af7a3a; }\n\n  /* 🍵 清透薄荷绿 */\n  .theme-mint {\n    background: #f4faf6 !important;\n    border: 2px solid #c8e6d9 !important;\n    color: #1e3d30 !important;\n  }\n  .theme-mint .t-title { color: #10ac84; font-weight: 800; }\n  .theme-mint .t-meta { background: #e3f5ed; color: #1b6ca8; border-left: 3px solid #10ac84; }\n  .theme-mint .t-box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); border: 1px solid #b8e2ce; color: #1e3d30; }\n  .theme-mint .t-foot { color: #10ac84; }\n\n  /* 📑 学术冷灰蓝 */\n  .theme-academic {\n    background: #f5f8fb !important;\n    border: 1px solid #cedfed !important;\n    border-top: 5px solid #4a90e2 !important;\n    color: #2c3e50 !important;\n  }\n  .theme-academic .t-title { color: #2980b9; font-weight: 800; }\n  .theme-academic .t-meta { background: #e8f1f8; color: #576574; font-family: monospace; }\n  .theme-academic .t-box { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d5e5f2; color: #2c3e50; line-height: 1.75; }\n  .theme-academic .t-foot { color: #7f8c8d; }\n\n  /* 💜 电光香芋紫 */\n  .theme-taro {\n    background: #fbf8ff !important;\n    border: 2px dashed #dec9f5 !important;\n    color: #3f275e !important;\n  }\n  .theme-taro .t-title { color: #8854d0; font-weight: 800; }\n  .theme-taro .t-meta { background: #f1e6ff; color: #6f42c1; border-radius: 6px; }\n  .theme-taro .t-box { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #ecd8ff; color: #3f275e; }\n  .theme-taro .t-foot { color: #a55eea; }\n\n  .t-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .t-badge { font-weight: 800; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n  .t-title { font-size: 14.5px; margin-bottom: 6px; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .t-meta { display: inline-block; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 3px 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .t-box { border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.75; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }\n  .t-foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11px; }\n\n  .handover-card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }\n  .handover-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .handover-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #4b6584; }\n  .handover-box { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; background: #f8fafc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #334155; user-select: text; -webkit-user-select: text; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"nav-tabs\">\n  <button class=\"tab-btn active\" id=\"btn-theater\" onclick=\"switchTab('theater')\">加演小剧场</button>\n  <button class=\"tab-btn\" id=\"btn-handover\" onclick=\"switchTab('handover')\">角色交接令</button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tab-content active\" id=\"tab-theater\">\n  <div class=\"theater-card theme-blush\" id=\"t-card\">\n    <div class=\"t-header\">\n      <span class=\"t-badge\" id=\"t-tag\">🌿 EXTRA SCENE</span>\n      <span id=\"t-sub\">余味切片</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"t-title\" id=\"t-title\">加演切片</div>\n    <div class=\"t-meta\" id=\"t-meta\">[切片记录]</div>\n    <div class=\"t-box\" id=\"t-body\">正在调取剧场内容...</div>\n    <div class=\"t-foot\">\n      <span id=\"t-foot-left\">寻常微澜 · 不计入主线记忆</span>\n      <span id=\"t-foot-right\">特别放映</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"tab-handover\">\n  <div class=\"handover-card\">\n    <div class=\"handover-header\">\n      <div class=\"handover-title\">📋 角色交接档案</div>\n      <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888\" id=\"h-tag\">长按文本可直接复制</span>\n    </div>\n    <pre class=\"handover-box\" id=\"h-content\">=== 角色交接档案 ===\n本轮为二人独处互动，无第三方角色出场与情报变动。\n=====================</pre>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nfunction switchTab(tab) {\n  document.getElementById('btn-theater').classList.toggle('active', tab === 'theater');\n  document.getElementById('btn-handover').classList.toggle('active', tab === 'handover');\n  document.getElementById('tab-theater').classList.toggle('active', tab === 'theater');\n  document.getElementById('tab-handover').classList.toggle('active', tab === 'handover');\n}\n(function(){\n  const raw = window.THEATER_RAW || window.STORY_RAW || `{{RAW}}` || '';\n  if (!raw.trim()) return;\n  const splitIdx = raw.indexOf('=== 角色交接档案');\n  let theaterPart = raw;\n  let handoverPart = '';\n  if (splitIdx !== -1) {\n    theaterPart = raw.substring(0, splitIdx).trim();\n    handoverPart = raw.substring(splitIdx).trim();\n  }\n  \n  const lines = theaterPart.split(/\\r?\\n/).map(l => l.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n  let title = '';\n  let meta = '[切片记录]';\n  let bodyLines = [];\n  let idx = 0;\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(lines.length, 3); i++) {\n    if (lines[i].includes('【') && lines[i].includes('】')) {\n      const m = lines[i].match(/【(.*?)】/);\n      if (m && m[1]) {\n        title = m[1].replace(/^[🎲\\s]+/, '').replace(/^小剧场[：:]\\s*/, '').replace(/^本轮随机剧场[：:]\\s*/, '');\n        idx = i + 1;\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  if (!title && lines.length > 0) {\n    title = lines[0];\n    idx = 1;\n  }\n\n  if (lines.length > idx && lines[idx].startsWith('[') && lines[idx].includes(']')) {\n    meta = lines[idx];\n    idx++;\n  }\n  bodyLines = lines.slice(idx);\n\n  document.getElementById('t-title').textContent = title || '加演切片';\n  document.getElementById('t-meta').textContent = meta;\n  document.getElementById('t-body').textContent = bodyLines.join('\\n\\n') || theaterPart;\n\n  const card = document.getElementById('t-card');\n  const tag = document.getElementById('t-tag');\n  const sub = document.getElementById('t-sub');\n  const fullText = (title + ' ' + theaterPart).toLowerCase();\n\n  if (fullText.includes('拍照') || fullText.includes('受害者') || fullText.includes('感谢卡') || fullText.includes('夸奖')) {\n    card.className = 'theater-card theme-polaroid';\n    tag.textContent = '📸 POLAROID MEMORY';\n    sub.textContent = '定格生活切片';\n  } else if (fullText.includes('撤回') || fullText.includes('辞职') || fullText.includes('快递') || fullText.includes('不能让他知道') || fullText.includes('对他别人') || fullText.includes('秘密')) {\n    card.className = 'theater-card theme-kraft';\n    tag.textContent = '✉️ KRAFT NOTE';\n    sub.textContent = '手撕纸条与秘密';\n  } else if (fullText.includes('监控') || fullText.includes('时间暂停') || fullText.includes('喜欢的东西') || fullText.includes('差一点') || fullText.includes('怪梦')) {\n    card.className = 'theater-card theme-mint';\n    tag.textContent = '🍵 PURE BREEZE';\n    sub.textContent = '静止与私密留白';\n  } else if (fullText.includes('甲方') || fullText.includes('教科书') || fullText.includes('专家') || fullText.includes('距离感')) {\n    card.className = 'theater-card theme-academic';\n    tag.textContent = '📑 OFFICIAL CASE';\n    sub.textContent = '严肃荒诞档案';\n  } else if (fullText.includes('角色卡') || fullText.includes('选择框') || fullText.includes('真话') || fullText.includes('搜索记录') || fullText.includes('投票') || fullText.includes('第四面墙')) {\n    card.className = 'theater-card theme-taro';\n    tag.textContent = '💜 GLITCH & TRUTH';\n    sub.textContent = '认知破壁与真心';\n  } else {\n    card.className = 'theater-card theme-blush';\n    tag.textContent = '🍓 HONEY & HEARTBEAT';\n    sub.textContent = '心跳与下意识反应';\n  }\n\n  if (handoverPart) {\n    document.getElementById('h-content').textContent = handoverPart;\n    if (handoverPart.includes('二人独处') || handoverPart.includes('无第三方')) {\n      document.getElementById('btn-handover').textContent = '角色交接令 (无变动)';\n      document.getElementById('h-tag').textContent = '独处场景';\n    } else {\n      document.getElementById('btn-handover').textContent = '角色交接令 (有新变动)';\n      document.getElementById('h-tag').textContent = '长按文本可直接复制';\n    }\n  } else {\n    document.getElementById('h-content').textContent = '=== 角色交接档案 ===\\n本轮为二人独处互动，无第三方角色出场与情报变动。\\n=====================';\n    document.getElementById('btn-handover').textContent = '角色交接令 (无变动)';\n    document.getElementById('h-tag').textContent = '独处场景';\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "preview": "【身体先于大脑行动 · 递过来的温水】\n[出场：林侑黎] ｜ [切片：寻常微澜]\n水壶的鸣笛声刚响，林侑黎的身体比理智快了整整半秒——还没等脑中筑起冷淡客气的防线，指尖已经自然而然地抽出一张隔热垫垫在桌上，甚至习惯性地在杯沿边缘兑了三分之一的冷矿泉水，正好是可以直接入口的温度。\n当他把冒着微温水汽的玻璃杯放到桌面时，整个人忽然像触电般僵住。\n他盯着那只杯子，下颌绷紧，似乎极度恼火自己这具被驯化出本能的身体，连解释都显得苍白又欲盖弥彰。\n\n=== 角色交接档案 ===\n本轮为二人独处互动，无第三方角色出场与情报变动。\n====================="
    }
  ]
}